rs/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":84012869,"digest":"sha256:211063c587df0e90cfdf49b9aaced9e9c719646ef2e0267e6d911806ca177226","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-29T18:42:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T18:42:41Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/releases/download/v0.2.0/CrumbTree-Setup-0.2.0.exe"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/tarball/v0.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/zipball/v0.2.0","body":"CrumbTree now runs on Linux as well as Windows.\n\n## What's new\n- **Linux.** A pacman package for Arch and Arch-based distros, and an AppImage for everything else.\n- **Compact Mode.** Hides everything that isn't needed so the commit list gets more room. Toggle it with Ctrl+Shift+M, the View menu or the command palette.\n- **New licence.** CrumbTree is now under the [PolyForm Shield License 1.0.0](https://github.com/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/blob/main/LICENSE.md). You can use it for anything, including commercial work, as long as you don't use it to make a competing product.\n\n## Install\n\n### Windows\n1. Download **CrumbTree-Setup-0.2.0.exe** below and run it.\n2. The installer isn't code-signed yet, so SmartScreen may warn you. Click **More info**, then **Run anyway**.\n3. You need [git](https://git-scm.com/downloads) installed.\n\n### Arch Linux\nDownload **crumbtree-0.2.0.pacman** below and install it. It pulls in git and the other libraries it needs.\n\n```bash\nsudo pacman -U crumbtree-0.2.0.pacman\n```\n\n### Other Linux distros\nDownload **CrumbTree-0.2.0.AppImage** below, make it executable and run it. You need git, and `fuse2` (`libfuse2` on Debian and Ubuntu).\n\n```bash\nchmod +x CrumbTree-0.2.0.AppImage\n./CrumbTree-0.2.0.AppImage\n```\n\nGit LFS and the GitHub CLI are optional. CrumbTree tells you when a feature needs one of them.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/releases/411920579","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/releases/411920579/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/releases/411920579/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/releases/tag/v0.1.0","id":411920579,"author":{"login":"cookiester34","id":47158495,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU4NDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47158495?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34","html_url":"https://github.com/cookiester34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOVH5Na84YjWjD","tag_name":"v0.1.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"CrumbTree 0.1.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":true,"created_at":"2026-10-13T17:09:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:10:01Z","published_at":"2026-10-13T17:10:01Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/releases/assets/637703672","id":637703672,"node_id":"RA_kwDOVH5Na84mApX4","name":"CrumbTree-Setup-0.1.0.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"cookiester34","id":47158495,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU4NDk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47158495?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34","html_url":"https://github.com/cookiester34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cookiester34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":84010712,"digest":"sha256:545d75a25c7590ce70588c8c304f517c6856b16090c8bc6579de04fa2e715af3","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-13T17:09:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:10:00Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/releases/download/v0.1.0/CrumbTree-Setup-0.1.0.exe"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/tarball/v0.1.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CookieJarTools/CrumbTree/zipball/v0.1.0","body":"First public preview of CrumbTree, a desktop git client with a vertical commit graph.\n\n## Install (Windows)\n1. Download **CrumbTree-Setup-0.1.0.exe** below and run it.\n2. The installer isn't code-signed yet, so SmartScreen may warn you. Click **More info → Run anyway**.\n3. You need [git](https://git-scm.com/downloads) installed. Git LFS and the GitHub CLI are optional.\n\n## Highlights\n- Vertical commit graph; the branch you're on stands out and other branches are dimmed\n- Stage by file or hunk, commit/amend, fetch/pull/push\n- Merge types (merge, squash, fast-forward, rebase) and a step-by-step conflict wizard\n- File history and blame\n- Git LFS manager\n- Minimal Mode: a simplified, plain-English workspace for non-developers\n- Multiple repos as tabs, command palette (Ctrl+K), built-in git terminal\n\n## Licence\nFree for non-commercial use under the [PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0](https://github.com/cookiester34/CrumbTree/blob/main/LICENSE.md).\n"}]